/-!
# Candidate-A spectral atlas from one unitary actual heat family

The preceding Candidate-A spectral derivation still accepted an actual zeta
family and a separate proof that its connection coefficient vanishes.  This
file replaces both by one `UnitaryActualZetaFamilyData` on the fixed H12 reduced
Hilbert space.

The actual finite part, Mellin continuation family, determinant and zero
connection coefficient are therefore all generated from

* one nuclear heat family transported by unitary conjugation;
* one H12 finite-part packet;
* one H12 Mellin continuation.

The base and local reference families, their analytic difference comparisons
and their standalone inverse-trace identities remain the only spectral inputs.
-/

